## Hints

- R3(c): half-width scales as 1/√n; needing it to drop from what you
  computed in (b) to 0.01 tells you the √n ratio — square it.
- R4: if your two SE flavors agree within ~5%, say so — agreement is
  informative (it means days 4–5 found little to repair *this time*).
- R5: the reviewer's strongest evidence is your day-4 tournament row
  (c) and day-5 tournament row — cite numbers, not adjectives.
